window.products.push({"id":648063,"name":"HeimenAogo Egyptian Cotton Duvet Cover Queen Size Sateen Weave, Silky Soft and Breathable Bedding Set with Zipper Closure, Long Staple Cotton Bed Line","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U8ahE9foL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY FABRIC: Indulge in the luxurious comfort of our sateen weave duvet cover set. Crafted with 100% long staple cotton, our high-quality yarns ensure a soft, durable, and delicate touch. Experience ultimate breathability and a cooling effect that prevents night sweats, giving your skin ample space to breathe. Enjoy the everlasting comfort of a 5-star hotel-style duvet cover at an affordable price. COMPLETE QUEEN SIZE SET: Our Queen duvet cover set includes 1 Queen duvet cover measuring 90\"W x 90\"L and 2 standard envelope pillowcases measuring 20\"W x 26\"L. Create a stylish and coordinated look for your bedroom with this thoughtfully designed set. Attention: Duvet /comforter insert is not included, needed to be purchased separately. LUXURIOUS DESIGN: Elevate your bedroom decor with our designer HeimenAogo solid colored duvet quilt cover and shams set. Crafted with a 600-thread-count Egyptian cotton, it offers a crisp look with a subtle sateen sheen, providing a silky soft feel that enhances your sleep experience. EXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP: Our bedding set is meticulously crafted in an OEKO-TEX Standard 100 factory, ensuring the highest quality standards. The hidden zipper design of the comforter cover and 8 interior corner ties keep your bedding securely in place. We have used a high-quality zipper and increased the number of stitches by 30% per inch to ensure durability and prevent tearing. EASY CARE: Our sateen weave cotton duvet cover is machine washable, and we recommend ironing at medium temperature for a polished look. At HEIMENAOGO, we prioritize your comfort and safety. If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to contact us, and we will respond promptly. This duvet cover set is the ultimate gift idea for Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year, and ideal for any bedroom, including guest rooms and vacation homes. BRIGHTEN YOUR SPACE WITH AURORA YELLOW: Illuminate your bedroom with the radiant beauty of our Aurora Yellow duvet cover set. This captivating shade of yellow resembles the vibrant colors of a breathtaking sunrise, infusing your space with warmth and positivity. The soothing and invigorating aura of Aurora Yellow creates a serene and uplifting ambiance, making it an ideal choice for those who seek a harmonious and cheerful bedroom setting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U8ahE9foL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HeimenAogo","source_asin":"B09LYP5RCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYP5RCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYP5RCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
