window.products.push({"id":648085,"name":"Kurt Adler Avocado Toast Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61beTNJjKvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our story begins after the close of World War II when Kurt Adler tried his hand at exporting general goods. As the business grew and European economies began to flourish, he changed direction to importing. Today, Kurt Adler remains a trusted company that has brought to life the memories of yesterday for millions of people. We are your one-stop source for all your holiday needs. Avocado Toast Figurine Ornament features toast with avocado and mayonnaise; Perfect for the foodie in your family. Ornament is made of resin stone with festive green finish. Decorative hanging figurine ornament measures approximately 3.5 inches tall; Hangs from red ribbon. Perfect for hanging display on a Christmas tree or ornament stand for the holidays. Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61beTNJjKvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kurt S. Adler","source_asin":"B07RVCDJVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RVCDJVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RVCDJVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648086,"name":"VBENLEM Manual Oil Press Stainless Steel Oil Press Machine Nut and Seed Oil Press Household","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61InANT+bYL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Manual Oil Press Machine Household Oil Expeller Extractor Peanut Nuts?USER NOTICE: 1) Assembly: Before operation, please fix the frame and make sure crank can be turned freely. Lubricate washer with edible oil and insert on screw shaft from the small end. Insert screw shaft in press cage.Screw on press cage cap and screw on terminal adjustment bolt. crank arm to screw shaft and tighten the bolt.Fill 80% fuel to the lamp bottle (kerosene or alcohol). Leave a 15cm wick through the washer.Leave 0.5cm of wick outside and put the longer end in the fuel bottle. Place washer at the bottle mouth.Place the lamp under press cage. Secure the lamp with rubber band.2) Heating To guarantee the oil output, the press cage should be heated for about 10 minutes.When the press cages temperature reaches 50-70?,material can be put into inlet for pressing.The lamp remains heating during pressing as well.3) Material?Raw material need be dry4) Operation:Make sure there is no impurities in the material before pressing.At the beginning of pressing,oil flowing the terminal adjustment bolt is normal. Loose the terminal adjustment bolt if the discharged cake is too dry and crank turning resistance is too big.Tighten the terminal adjustment bolt if the discharged cake contains too mach oil residual.5) Tip:When you squeeze the small particles for oil,like sesame. User can take peanut crude extract,after the machine can slag out oil normally,can add small particles,so that can be more smoothly.6) Cleaning:The machine need be clean before first using. Also need to clean it immediately after operation.?SpecificationsMaterial: Stainless SteelSize: 270X50X350 mm Oil Mill Size (Including Packaging)Package Size: 375X300X75 mmAttach","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61InANT+bYL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VBENLEM","source_asin":"B07V2SKLXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V2SKLXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V2SKLXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
