window.products.push({"id":648129,"name":"WÜSTHOF Gourmet Eight Inch Carving Knife | 8\" German Carving Knife | Precise Laser Cut High Carbon Stainless Steel Utility Knife – Model","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174uJFXmwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since their humble beginnings in 1814, the Wusthof family business has adhered to the same basic set of principles regarding their products. Their trident logo is a representation of these principles, a symbol of form, function, and uncompromising quality. Today, Wusthof stands firm behind a strong line of products, including an assortment of more than 350 forged knives, as well as cutting boards, knife blocks, kitchen tools, and scissors, all of which are produced by dedicated workers at state-of-the-art facilities in Solingen, Germany. Durable hi-carbon and metal construction. Full-tang, high-impact 3-rivet handle. Long-lasting sharp edge for boning raw meats and poultry. Hand washing recommended. Dimensions: 12L x 1W x 0.5H inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174uJFXmwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wüsthof","source_asin":"B00A31JFSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A31JFSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A31JFSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
