window.products.push({"id":648139,"name":"VERONES Large Tall Airtight Food Storage Containers, 10 PACK Plastic Airtight Kitchen & Pantry Organization, Ideal for Flour & Sugar - BPA-Free Plasti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eFO6NlJZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FOR DIFFERENT STORAGE - Our food storage container set comes with 10 containers of 3 different sizes, making it a must-have in the kitchen. It includes 2 extra large containers (6.5 L / 220 oz), 2 tall containers( 5.2 L / 176 oz), 6 medium containers ( 2.5 L / 85 oz), 2 measuring cups, 20 labels and 1 marker. HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS - Made of food grade material, they are BPA free. These pantry storage containers are not only long-lasting, but they will also be effortless to clean, dishwasher safe. The transparent body makes it easy to know how much of an item is still left. AITRIGHT LID KEEP YOUR FOOD SAFE & FRESH - Our airtight food storage containers come with Side-locking lids that ensure maximum freshness and prolonged food storage by sealing tightly. They keep air and moisture out of the food, making your food stay fresh longer. IDEAL FOR STORING DRY FOOD - VERONES kitchen storage containers are perfect for many kinds of dry food and baking supplies, such as flour, sugar, rice, grain, chips, cereals, nuts, beans, snacks, pasta, coffee and tea. Plus wide enough openings to reach in with measuring cup. SPACE EFFICIENT STORAGE - With the stackable design, these plastic storage containers will make more efficient use of every inch of your home kitchen. Whether you have a large or small pantry, these stylish containers will help you organize your kitchen and pantry better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eFO6NlJZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VERONES","source_asin":"B08QV9QRP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QV9QRP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QV9QRP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
