window.products.push({"id":648199,"name":"Rikki Knight RK-LGCB-1346 Van Gogh Art Red Poppies Glass Cutting Board, Large, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qYbbtobHL._AC_SL1008_.jpg","description":"This eye catching Tempered and coated Glass Cutting Board by Rikki Knight measures 15.3\" X 11.3\" and is not only beautiful, but also very useful and practical for home chef's and restaurant owner's alike. This functional, sanitary, and heat resistant glass cutting surface is ideal for slicing, dicing, and mincing or use as a protective work space for your saucepans and hot dishes in the kitchen. The cutting board Includes self-adhesive rubber feet and when placed against the wall in a standing position, these cutting boards are ideal for decorative purposes as well! Our professional coat will ensure that it will always remain great to look at whilst making a terrific conversation piece in the kitchen. Disclaimer: All images are printed directly into the material - The Texture of the image will always be a flat surface. Any images that appears to be 3-D, textured, or glittery are flat printed images. This product is proudly printed in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qYbbtobHL._AC_SL1008_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rikki Knight","source_asin":"B00CR4EV8O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CR4EV8O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CR4EV8O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648200,"name":"Charleston Bay Sleep Tite 300 Thread Count Stretch Fit 100-Percent Cotton Luxury 4-Piece Sheet Set, King, Sage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314FTH2PTAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Sleep Tite Stretch Fit Oversized Sheet Set--The biggest consumer complaint about fitted sheets was that they didn't fit well or stay in place. Research conducted by Cotton Inc.'s Lifestyle Monitor found that 41-percent of consumers had a problem with the bottom bed sheet fitting properly. 90-percent said they would buy a sheet with stretch properties, while 88-percent said they would pay more for such a product. We've designed a sheet that not only fits perfectly on every mattress but also did it without breaking the bank. Our Patent pending design guarantees the fitted sheet will never shift or slip. In fact, it actually fits better after laundering. These amazing sheets and pillowcases are sewn from fine-woven 300 thread-count 100-percent long staple cotton that has been mercerized. The benefits are that it creates sheets and pillowcases that have a beautiful sheen, higher luster, increased durability and are extremely smooth to the hand. The fitted sheet is the Star of this amazing set. The typical fitted sheet only has 1 band of elastic to keep it in place allowing it to shift, bunch and pull up off the corners overnight. The Sleep Tite fitted sheet is a one-piece seamless construction and has an incredible 15 parallel lines of high-quality elastic built into the head and foot which allows it to stretch and conform to any mattress from 7-to-20 inches thick for an amazing fit every time. There is no skirt or inserted material to rip or tear meaning it will never lose tension or come loose from the bed. It is perfect to use on pillow top mattresses, air beds and mattresses that have an additional mattress topper or pad. This king size 4-piece sheet set includes an oversized 108-by104 inch flat sheet for full coverage; two 20-by-40 inch king size pillowcases and a 78-by-80 inch stretch fit fitted sheet. Both the flat sheet and the pillowcases come with a 4-inch turn back hem treatment for a fully finished look. Machine wash/dry. Amazon.com Enjoy a comfortable night's sleep every night of the week with this affordable set of 300-thread-count King sheets. The set, which includes a king flat sheet, king fitted sheet, and two king pillowcases--all in an elegant white color--is made of 100-percent cotton with a sateen fabric finish. The sateen weave is particularly compelling, as it gives the sheets a lustrous shine and a soft, silky feel. Meanwhile, the fitted sheet is extra secure thanks to the long elastic band, which stretches all the way around the edges rather than sitting in the corners only. You'll also appreciate the fitted sheet's extra-deep pockets, which are designed to fit premium mattresses. Conversely, the flat sheet and pillowcases sport double-needle hems around the edges for added durability. A final bonus stems from the material's easy-clean instructions. Simply toss the pre-shrunk sheets and cases in the washing machine and dryer, where they'll only get softer with each cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314FTH2PTAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Charleston Bay","source_asin":"B000F5X9WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000F5X9WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000F5X9WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
