window.products.push({"id":648418,"name":"Andi Lynn's Silicone Gummy Molds Pack of 10 - Fruit Snack Molds - Healthy Candy Molds with Droppers - Food Grade Silicone Mold - 42 Gummies per Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B6yLmqkXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack of 10 Molds: Andi Lynn's Pure & Custom Formulary brings you an incredible gummy-making deal. It includes 10 silicone candy molds and 10 droppers. The molds offer different fruit shapes, banana, grapes, pineapples, strawberries, oranges. Food-Grade Silicone: We invest in high-quality materials; that's why our soft silicone molds are made of BPA-free, food-grade silicone. With 10 silicone candy mold trays, you can make a greater batch of fruit gummies to last for 2 to 3 months. Healthy Snacks: No one wants their kids to consume unhealthy snacks all the time. If you wish to amuse your kids with a healthy snack, get our fruit-shaped gummy mold silicone trays now. Our gummy molds help you make gelatin-based adorable gummies effortlessly. Easy to Use: The soft silicone mold trays are not only flexible but also non-stick and heat-resistant temperature -40℃- 230℃. The molds can be used to make gelatin-based gummies, candy, ice cubes, chocolate, and more. Each silicon mold comes with its own small dropper. Fun DIY Project: With these gummy-making silicone molds, you can have a lot of fun with your kids or friends making healthy fruit-shaped gummies. You can make organic gummies to boost your immune system while sharing happy times with your loved ones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B6yLmqkXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Andi Lynn's Pure & Custom Formulary","source_asin":"B0BGSV6FK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGSV6FK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGSV6FK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
