window.products.push({"id":648420,"name":"Toilet Tattoos, Toilet Seat Cover Decal, Ladybug, Size Round","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GNqxz6CnL._AC_.jpg","description":"Toilet Tattoos is a removable, reusable, decorative appliqué for the toilet lid. The modern way to enhance your commode. In seconds, transform the look of your lid, simply peel from backer card, place and smooth. Made in the USA from electrostatic vinyl film, it will not harm your lid and wipes clean; No adhesives means you can use them again and again. Available to fit round and elongated toilets; round (actual size 12-inch X 13.5-inch) and elongated (12- inch X 15-inch). Made for use on standard smooth toilet seats. Not for use on soft cushion seats or brown wooden seats. May need to apply by using water for some plastic lids. Winner of the Retailers’ Choice Award, Toilet Tattoos are the only way to crown your throne. Patent No 8,898,941","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GNqxz6CnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toilet Tattoos","source_asin":"B003EGGGIM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003EGGGIM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003EGGGIM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
