window.products.push({"id":648557,"name":"Flower Vase Acrylic Tall Rectangle - Decorative Centerpiece for Home or Wedding - Non Breakable Plastic, 5\" X10 - Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rv5v5DVjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY: This Hard Plastic square vase is crafted of premium quality acrylic and is made of crystal clear material to maximize content visibility. This vase features thick acrylic walls and weighted base to ensure durability. BEST SELLER: Hard plastic vases, commonly referred to as clear acrylic holders are best sellers in the floral supply, home décor, and wedding planning industry since numerous venues would not allow glassware. From home decorators, to event planners, everyone makes use of a good quality non-breakable vase. It will enhance any romantic event when filled with flowers and branches or any party when filled with lights and vase fillers. BREAK RESISTANT: These hard plastic vases are made of high quality acrylic. Its Heavy Duty material which is used in the manufacturing of this product is specifically designed to withstand heavy handling. Unlike glass, acrylic vases are perfect alternatives to glassware in high traffic areas and homes with kids and pets. USES: Acrylic flower vases are very popular with fresh flower arrangements as well as silk or dried floral designs. But it is also commonly used as candle holders, storage containers and centerpieces for food. It makes a great around-the-house piece as it can be dropped to the floor without shattering. DIMENSIONS: This plastic square vase measures 5 inches wide X 10 inches high.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rv5v5DVjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Imports","source_asin":"B08BQFDR54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BQFDR54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BQFDR54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648558,"name":"Java Swivel Rocking Chair White Wash White Cushion Handmade Natural Wicker Rattan Furniture with Ottoman Krit White Wash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":484.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jCssF2UdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There is no place like home. And our friendly family owned company is doing our best to make your living space nice, warm and comfortable. Rattan furniture is a perfect solution for your house. Extremely strong, rattan wicker furniture is stylish and lasts for many years. The benefit of our rattan and wicker is that each piece is fully assembled, which is a sign of superior quality. You will certainly enjoy this amazing and comfortable set containing Java Swivel chair and Ottoman Krit. Why is it so unique? Firstly, all products of this set are made from natural rattan, class A – ECO-friendly material, which comes to us from Indonesia. Secondly, this furniture will bring both comfort and style to your place. A wonderfully sized seat and a pleasant traditional style make Java Chair one of our best selling products. The quality and beauty of our rattan products began from our passion and attention to details. That’s why it is an excellent decor addition to any place of your home. If you prefer contemporary furniture style, you will also adore the Ottoman Krit. Rich color, quality cushion, attention to each detail adorned with natural rattan of class A – create a sophisticated look of this product. Sit, relax and feel the Asian atmosphere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jCssF2UdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wickerix","source_asin":"B01FT10F2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FT10F2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FT10F2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648559,"name":"Progressive International DEC-1519 Drawer Organizer Expandable, white","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610vbp5j7DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep junk drawers, utensils drawers or office drawers perfectly organized with this Prepworks by Progressive Customizable Organizer. The innovative, expandable compartment extends lengthwise from 15\" to 20\" to accommodate deeper drawers. The non-skid base helps to keep the organizer from shifting in the drawer and has 5 different areas for storage. This item is dishwasher safe for easy clean up. For over 40 years, our mission has been to create innovative kitchen tools and gadgets that make food preparation fun and fast while inspiring culinary creativity. From our thinstore™ collapsibles to our sophisticated PL8™ line, our dedication to providing quality products supported by superior customer service continues to drive our creative development today. At Progressive International, we continually strive to understand the needs of today’s cooks. Our team includes talented, energetic and passionate people committed to reimagining the kitchen. We strive to pass our passion on to our consumers through our thoughtfully designed tools, layered with our avid desire to go beyond the expected. Our philosophy is simple: offer stylish designs complimented by no-nonsense functionality. We understand the kitchen is the heart of the home, where families and friends connect.  Our ongoing mission is to provide exceptional kitchen essentials that help cooks of all skill levels create meals worth sharing. Prep Solutions;, Prepworks and PL8 continues to build on the Progressive; legacy by offering products that make food prep faster, easier and more enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610vbp5j7DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Progressive International","source_asin":"B00J30DSTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J30DSTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J30DSTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648560,"name":"ABeadedCurtain 125 String Waikiki Beaded Curtain Handmade with 4000 Beads (+Hanging Hardware) 38% More Strands and Beads Multicolored","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ynw7uDeaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Handmade and hand painted: Each of our beaded curtains begins with approximately 4000 beads cut into 2.5\" sections from natural bamboo stalks. The bamboo beads are then strung together by hand using wire to create a strand. 125 strands are then attached to a wooden hanging bar to create a bamboo beaded curtain. Finally, each bead and strand is individually hand painted producing the art you see on each beaded curtain. Since each bead is entirely painted the image is viewable on both sides of the curtain from any angle. Highest quality with 125 strands: Our hand painted bamboo beaded curtains are the highest quality beaded curtains currently being manufactured. Each bamboo curtain is truly in a class of its own. We have been making beaded curtains since 2001 and have learned by trial, error, and customer feedback. From our experience we have found 125 strands to be the ideal number of strands per curtain. This strand count provides curtain density, durability, and vivid image detail. With less than 125 strands, you lose density and detail in the painting. With greater than 125 strands, the bead diameter becomes too small making the beads fragile and prone to breaking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ynw7uDeaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABeadedCurtain","source_asin":"B003A1I7OC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003A1I7OC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003A1I7OC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648561,"name":"VSUDO Decorative Privacy Window Film, No Glue Decor Static Cling Glass Sticker, Anti-UV Window Tint for Home or Office (Living Room/Bathroom/Kitchen)(","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ekO98EToL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","description":"Can we protecting our privacy and keeping the room still bright by natural sunlight? The answer is YES. Our decorative privacy window film can help you to make it happen. Highlight Features: -Protecting privacy and keep home or office bright -Decorate home to be more fashionable -No glue/no adhensive design, static clings to the glass firmly, far away harmful chemicals -Blocking 95% of UV ray away and filtering strong sunlight, prevent furniture from aging and fading -Reusable, ideal for rental places. No residue left on the glass, you can reposition it and reuse Where to use? -The static cling decor window film applies to any smooth glass surface, it can be trimmed or combined to fit any size window. -You can use our window films on windows of living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and use on front door window, sliding glass door window, glass cabinet panels. This window film fits for office, house, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Installation Steps: 1. Cut films to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window 2. Clean the glass surface 3. Use the spray bottle, wet the glass with soapy water or clear water 4. Peel off the back protective film 5. Stick films on glass 6. Use the squeegee to remove the water and air bubbles 7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges Package Include: 1 Roll Window Film: 17.7 inch By 78.7 inch (45 X 200CM) Tips: 1. This product is only suitable for smooth, flat and clean glass surface.Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials. 2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. 3. This window film can show the colors perfectly just when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ekO98EToL._AC_SL1004_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSUDO","source_asin":"B07RQNK66L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQNK66L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQNK66L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
