window.products.push({"id":648573,"name":"Tv Remote Control Holder for Table | Wooden Remote Control Caddy Fits 3+ Remotes | Farmhouse Remote Controller Holder for Bed | Remote Control Organiz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CZsT306yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEVER LOSE YOUR REMOTE AGAIN: Are you tired of constantly misplacing your Tv remote? Look no further than the Emerson West remote control caddy! Our TV controller holder is the perfect way to keep all of your remotes in one place, so you never have to go searching for them again. With its farmhouse-inspired design, not only will you finally have a designated spot for all of your remotes, but you'll also be adding a stylish accent piece to your living room decor. KEEP ALL YOUR REMOTES IN ONE PLACE: The Emerson West remote box is designed to easily accommodate three or more remotes by ensuring that you always have quick access to all of your TV and AC controllers when you need them.Our versatile remote control holders are perfect for use in every room of your home, making them the ultimate home organization accessory. Whether you need a bed remote control holder for your bedside table, coffee table, or couch, this remote stand can do it all! INTRODUCING THE PERFECT BLEND OF DURABILITY AND ELEGANCE: This wooden remote caddy for bed is crafted using lightweight and sturdy paulownia wood. Soft pads at the bottom of remote control holder for table protect your surfaces from scuffs or scratches. Not only is our remote organizer a practical solution to TV accessories clutter, but it also adds a touch of elegance to any room. This beautiful wood grain and minimalist design make this TV remote caddy, a stylish addition to your home decor. PERFECT SOLUTION TO YOUR CLUTTERED Table: The Emerson West Wooden Desk Organizer features a rich stained finish and the word \"Remotes\" written in cursive using white ink. With a compact design measuring 5x3.2x3.5 inches, our couch remote holder is the perfect size for any space. Keep it on your coffee table or end table for easy access to your remote caddy for table or use it as desktop organizer in your home office to organize your desk. OUR COMMITMENT TO QUALITY: At Emerson West, we pride ourselves on providing smart solutions for your beautiful life. As a mom-owned, US-based small business we will never sell a product that we do not use in our own home. We stand behind our products with complete confidence - if you are not 100% satisfied, simply reach out and let us know how we can make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CZsT306yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emerson West","source_asin":"B08Z88BP9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z88BP9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z88BP9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
