window.products.push({"id":648587,"name":"Cuisinart DCC-1250SA Grind & Brew 12 Cup Coffee Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DaDhZJI9L._AC_.jpg","description":"For those of us who consider coffee not just a simple \"drink\", but rather, a cornerstone of our daily life and the fuel that keeps our lifes going (take it from a father of twins that runs his own business!!). The Coffee you need from the name you know and trust, Cuisinart. This deluxe coffeemaker not only helps you start your day right, by brewing rich, delicious coffee starting with grinding the beans, but also keeps you going during the day, by keeping it hot all day, (so you can keep your eyes open until you clock out). With fully automatic controls including an auto shutoff, you can program this coffeemaker to grind the beans and make your fresh coffee any time of day. And lets say that you just want a few cups of coffee (not 12!), well with the Brew Pause feature, this coffeemaker can make between 1 and 4 cups of coffee without wasting the other 8 cups. And when it comes time to clean up, this coffeemaker has a 2 piece grinding assembly, and a filter basket that are completely dishwasher safe. For those of us who dont just want another cheap coffee maker, this Cuisinart Coffeemaker is what you have been waiting for. (Description written and copyrighted by Seller GottaLoveMovies)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DaDhZJI9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B0039ZN14A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0039ZN14A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0039ZN14A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648588,"name":"4.3 Cloud9 Full / Double 4 Inch 100% Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UktLdnGuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4.3 Cloud Visco Elastic Memory Foam out performs and relieves painful pressure points better than the leading competitor with innovative visco elastic memory foam technology and better formulation to help you sleep through the night without tossing and turning, allowing you to awake refreshed and renewed after a good nights sleep.Cloud9 Visco-elastic foam - memory foam - provides an ideal sleeping surface. In normal temperatures it is firm, but when you lay down to sleep it reacts to the temperature of your body and begins to mold itself to your shape. Weight is then distributed evenly along the surface, relieving pressure and helping you to sleep more soundly without tossing and turning. Cloud9 Memory Foam Contours perfectly and molds to your body, superior pressure relief reduces back pain, increased circulation for a deep sleep. They go right on top of your bed - very useful for making a firm, hard or old mattress much more comfortable. The \"Featherlight Sleep System\" will kindle a sincere delight when it's time to retire for the night. Our exclusive, \"Featherlight\" formula makes you feel like you are floating on CLOUD9, sailing forth into a sea of enchanted dreams. We usually recommend that if the person using the visco-elastic memory foam mattress pad weighs under 200lbs and they are just looking for added comfort they should get a 2\" visco-elastic memory foam mattress pad, if they weigh over 200 we definitely recommend a 3\" visco-elastic memory foam mattress pad and for those that weigh over 250lbs the 4\" toppers are the best option for pressure point relief and comfort. The 3.3 Cloud9 visco-elastic memory foam is SUPER SOFT being less dense and having a softer compression or ILD rating. The 4.3 Cloud9 Topper is slightly firmer and provides a little more support while at the same time remaining soft and supple with a slightly more supportive compression or ILD. Our most luxurious 5.3 Cloud9 visco elastic memory foam is firmer than the 3.3 and 4.3 Cloud9.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UktLdnGuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloud9 Bedding Memory Foam","source_asin":"B0017ZT2VU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0017ZT2VU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0017ZT2VU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648589,"name":"Tooletries - The Catcher - Bottle Opener with Silicone Grip Technology & Built-In Magnet to Catch Caps - Removable & Reusable - For Home Fridge, Showe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fSLU5QMnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CATCH THE CATCHER - Looking to crack a cold one open whether you're at home or on a boat? Meet the Catcher, the best way to open your bottle with speed, ease, and a single hand. The magnetic build will catch the caps before they hit the floor GRIPS STRONG - Thanks to our patent silicone-grip technology, our products will stick to shiny surfaces both securely and with ease. Surfaces include glass, mirrors, shiny tiles, and more. No more adhesives and no more suction cups PEEL, PLACE, PRESS, READY - Installation is simple. First, clean the surface you want to use. Second, peel the backing film off. Third, place the product on the surface smoothing any bubble as you go. For best results wait about 12 hours before use REMOVABLE & REUSABLE - Tooletries products are removable & reusable. Designed for use in the shower, on a kitchen fridge, in a boat, RV, Garage, with a BBQ, or any shiny surface. Simply remove, wipe, and then reapply for product cleaning and care PRODUCT DIMENSIONS - The Catcher bottle opener is conveniently sized at 7.5\" (L) x 3.5\" (W) x 1.2\" (D) / 19cm (L) x 9cm (W) x 3cm (D) perfect for cracking one open, and making it easy to store, install, and take with you when you travel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fSLU5QMnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tooletries","source_asin":"B09P41SVFB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P41SVFB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P41SVFB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
