window.products.push({"id":648644,"name":"FoundGo Electric Grain Mill 10.6oz/300g Commercial Grain Grinder Stainless Steel Powder Grinding Machine 25,000rpm Pulverizer for Spice/Coffee/Flour/P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jqLbSU5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Super Safe]: Our electric grain mill has already gained UL certification, FCC certification, CE certification. And to protect your and your families’ safety, its highly sensing monitor will automatically stop the grinding machine if it is overheated or overweight. Besides, high-quality stainless steel will protect the grinder from corrosion and prolong its service life. [Easy to Clean & Maintenance]: After every grinding, please brush off the powder left in the bucket, and then wrap inside & outside clean with a dry cloth. NOTE：THE GRAIN MILL CAN’T BE WASHED. After finishing the cleaning steps, please place the grinding machine in a shady and dry place. Because there is sharp blades in the machine, please place it in a high place out of reach of children. [Superfine Powder]: Power: 2,400W; Capacity: 10.6oz/300g; Speed: 25,000rpm; Working time: no more than 5 minutes. FoundGo grain mill is specialized in grounding dried material into 60 to 300 mesh superfine powder within one minutes, while some extremely hard materials need to takes 2-3min. [Timing Design & Easy to Use]: You can precisely time the grinding machine from 0 min to five minute. Free your hands and working more efficiently. After filling the seeds you want to grind, close the lid, and them put the red button to start. To avoid injury, please be aware that the lid is tightly closed before you press the “start” button. [Suitable for Various Dried Food Materials]: The grain miller can grind various dried materials, including ①grains (soy beans, corn, , coffee beans, barley, rice, wheat, oats, rye, peas, mung beans), ②spices (black pepper, fennel, pepper, cinnamon, Chinese prickly ash) ③traditional Chinese herbs (ginseng, astragalus, gastrodia, Shijie, Ganoderma) When using grinding machine to grind pearls, Ganoderma lucidum or other tough materials, Please Cut Them To Small Pieces First.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jqLbSU5bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FoundGo","source_asin":"B0BLYTWWCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLYTWWCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLYTWWCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648645,"name":"BOYULL Chinese Zodiac Dog Golden Resin Collectible Figurines Table Decor Statue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710nEfwsJkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"About Chinese zodiac:The Chinese animal zodiac, or shengxiao (born resembling), is a repeating cycle of 12 years, with each year being represented by an animal and its reputed attributes. Traditionally these zodiac animals were used to date the years.In order, the 12 animals are: Rat, Ox, Tiger, Rabbit, Dragon, Snake, Horse, Goat, Monkey, Rooster, Dog, Pig. Years of the Dog include 1934, 1946, 1958, 1970, 1982, 1994, 2006, 2018, and 2030. Dogs are loyal and honest, amiable and kind, cautious and prudent. Due to having a strong sense of loyalty and sincerity, Dogs will do everything for the person who they think is most important. Lucky Numbers: 3, 4, 9 Lucky Color: golden, silver","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710nEfwsJkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOYULL","source_asin":"B0BT993YR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT993YR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT993YR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
