window.products.push({"id":648671,"name":"Chic Home Aquatic 8 Piece Reversible Comforter Life in The Sea Theme Print Design Bed in a Bag-Sheet Set Pillowcases Decorative Pillow Shams Included,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hBVmDuIcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A modern comforter set with everything you need to give your bedroom a bold, fresh look. The comforter features a contemporary \"Life in the Sea\" theme on the face featuring starfish, conches and shells on a white field with a minimalist, solid color design on the reverse. Design coordinated super-soft microfiber sheets, pillowcases, reversible pillow shams and an embroidered decorative pillow are included to complete the look. Specifications: • Size: Queen • Color Scheme: Tan, Blue, White • Piece Count: 8 • Set Includes: • 1pc Reversible Comforter (90” x 90”) • 2pc Reversible Pillow Shams (20” x 26” + 2”) • 1pc Embroidered Decorative Pillow (12” x 18”) • 1pc Flat Sheet (90” x 108”) • 1pc Fitted Sheet (60” x 80” + 12” Deep Pocket) • 2pc Pillowcases (21” x 27” + 3\") • Materials: Luxuriously brushed microfiber fabric, hypoallergenic synthetic down alternative filling Fabric and Design: • Soft brushed microfiber cotton-feel material • Fashion forward \"Life in the Sea\" print theme on the face with a solid color backing Features: • Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning • Hypoallergenic alternative down filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down materials • Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low * Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hBVmDuIcS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B07N291BV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N291BV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N291BV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
