window.products.push({"id":648712,"name":"UHOOP Electric Can Opener, Restaurant can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener! Chef's Best Choice, Best Kitchen Gadget for Arthritis, Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610kg2MQVQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Features: ☀Simple operation: Lock the electric can opener on the can, press the one key button, the can opener will work automatically. How to use: ✿Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel. ✿Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can. ✿Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter. ✿Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can. Trouble shooting: ☀If the battery is exhausted, it may not be possible to release the can by pressing the button. You can continue working after changing the battery. ☀If the edge of the can is not smooth, the can opener will be stuck. If it is stuck, follow the steps in the instructions to unlock the can opener. ☀If the can is stuck, press the white button on the top of the can opener. ➽ Precautions: ① Please read all instructions carefully before using the can opener ② This can opener is not suitable for children, please keep out of reach of children ③ Make sure the motor is completely stopped before removing the bottom cover ④ For more information, please refer to the instruction manual ⑤ Always keep away from the blade to avoid injury when using and replacing batteries!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610kg2MQVQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UHOOP","source_asin":"B0933F1N29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0933F1N29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0933F1N29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
