window.products.push({"id":648751,"name":"9Pcs Stainless Steel Measuring Cups and Spoons Set, Rose Gold Metal Measuring Spoons and Cups with Engraved Measurements & Mirror Polished for Dry, Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619WBB+0V4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Rose Gold Measuring Cups and Spoons Set – By Good For You Not only does this copper set look amazing in the kitchen but, it's been engineered for accuracy and convenience. You'll also find this set will meet all of your measuring needs, especially if you're baking that perfect dish or keeping an eye on your calorie intake. Each piece also contains metric equivalents so you'll never have to use a conversion chart again. Premium Quality Copper Plated Stainless Steel Our measuring set of 4 cups and 5 spoons is a safer and stronger option than plastic or other metal sets. heavy-duty copper-plated stainless steel will never rust, nor absorb colour and odor. Each set has a removable ring allows for individual use or as a hanging solution making these nesting measuring cups and spoons a great space saver in your kitchen. ENGRAVED MEASURING MARKINGS: Every cup and spoon in this 9 piece set has accurate Metric and US measurement sizes engraved clearly on the handles to help you reduce any measuring errors for cooking or baking. No more rubbing or fading off markings, as these engraved measurements will never fade or wear away. 11-Piece Measuring Cups and Spoons Set Heavy Duty Construction: 18/8 stainless steel with heavy duty single-piece construction & wide handles (no-welds, no-rivets, or soldered handles) Built to Last a Lifetime: will never rust, stain, corrode, break, or warp Premium-Quality: stamped measurements on cups, laser engraved measurements on spoons Easy-to-Read: partial measurements are stamped & visible on the outside and inside of cups Precise Measurements: both metric and standard All-Purpose: accurately measure wet & dry ingredients Space Saving: stackable, nesting design Easy to Clean: this set is dishwasher-safe with a smooth rounded bottom What You","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619WBB+0V4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOUUA","source_asin":"B096ZVW1G1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096ZVW1G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096ZVW1G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
