window.products.push({"id":648829,"name":"UVOGOM 20x20 Pillow Insert 2 Packs Decorative Fluffy Premium Hypoallergenic Square Pillows,Cushion, Sham, Stuffer for Sofa Bed Couch Car","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NPa+Jol9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"💗premium Filler: These Throw Pillow Inserts Are Filled With 7d Hypoallergenic Cotton With Good Resilience and Softness. 💗VACUUM PACKED: Set of 2 pillow inserts are vacuum packed for easy shipping. Cut open the plastic package and pat evenly to gain fully plush. TIP: Exposure to the sun would fluffy faster. 💗FLUFFY & DECORATIVE: Lumbar pillows are well-filled so it can keep the good shape brilliantly. These square pillows perfectly suitable for sofa, chair, bed ,couch and any elegant pillow cases to fill out and decorate your space. 💗HYPOALLERGENIC & ODORLESS: Sofa pillows filled with 100% hypoallergenic down cotton which is non-allergenic and dust free. The covers are high-quality brushed polyester fabric that super durable, comfortable and skin-friendly. Never worry about hurting your kids or pets without pillowcases. 💗EASY TO CLEAN AND DRY: Throw pillow inserts are machine washable. Please wash it in gentle cycle with warm water and tumble dry. In fact, as long as put it exposed to sun, it is not necessary to wash it frequently. 💗INVISIBLE ZIPPIER: Foam pillow insert comes with a hidden zipper. If cotton goes off course you can open the zipper to keeps all the fill in place.If you feel too fluffy you can take out some cotton and adjust. 💗SIZE RECOMMENDATION: For the best result this 18\"x18\" pillow insert is recommended for 16\"x16\" or 18\"x18\" sham covers to provide a plump and full pillow from corner to corner. Besides, we recommend 20\"x 20\" pillow inserts if your pillowcase is 18\" by 18\" or. 20\" by 20\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41NPa+Jol9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UVOGOM","source_asin":"B0897QMWLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0897QMWLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0897QMWLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648830,"name":"Josnown Automatic Liquid Soap Dispenser, 13.5oz/400ML Wall Mount Soap Dispenser, USB Rechargeable, Touchless Hand & Dish Soap Dispenser Waterproof Pum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512G2Ah86vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AUTO TOUCHLESS - Josnown automatic liquid soap dispenser adopts precise infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology. Just put your hand under the sensor port at 0-7cm(2.75''), and it will quickly dispense soap within 0.25s, providing 4 levels of liquid output. USB-C FAST CHARGE - Our rechargeable soap dispensers can be used with the proper USB Type-C cable(included) and will last 3000-4000 uses on a full charge. Super battery life avoids frequent charging, reduces the cost and hassle of battery replacement, and is more environmentally friendly than other soap dispensers with batteries. IPX5 WATERPROOF & SAFE DESIGN - The automatic soap dispenser with IPX5 waterproof technology effectively prevents soap or water from affecting the battery compartment and then extends the product's life. Splash-proof and prevent accidental touch to dispense soap. NO DRILLING, WALL MOUNTABLE - The touchless soap dispenser is available for countertop mount and wall mount. It is compact and minimalist, which saves more space and keeps your space clean and tidy. WIDELY USED SOAP DISPENSER - The soap dispenser comes with a 400ml large capacity container, no need to refill soap frequently. Dish soap, shower gel, shampoo, and hand soap can be loaded directly into this electric soap dispenser, it can be used in bathroom, kitchen, kindergarten, hotel, school, restaurant, etc. If you have any questions about the product, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512G2Ah86vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Josnown","source_asin":"B0BWXWX3WB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWXWX3WB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWXWX3WB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
