window.products.push({"id":648836,"name":"#1 Set of 3 Kitchen Balloon Stainless Steel Whisks–8\" 10\" & 12 inch–Best Utensils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31qrNabBUZL._AC_.jpg","description":"*VERSATILITY: They are perfect for stirring or whipping either hot or cold food, drinks, mixes; just about anything you'd need a good action type stirring instrument for! Great for combining dry ingredients to make a spice blend. It’s much better then a plain spoon. *STAINLESS STEEL: Easy to clean and durable and won't rust *3 DIFFERENT SIZES: The right size for the job. The small one is great for involving the kids in the kitchen and quite convenient for small tasks. The medium size can be used for whisking eggs for scrambling or whites to froth. The largest one is great for thin to medium-thick batters. With all three you can whisk more than one food at a time without washing between. *QUALITY: Be pleasantly surprised by the quality. These are stiff and sturdy making them a good quality for a good value. They feel good in the hand and hold up well in the dishwasher. Handles are well sealed so water doesn't get into them and then dribble out as is common in inexpensive whisks. *CONVENIENT: The handles have hooks that are convenient for a small kitchen so that you have the option of hanging them from a hook. *NO EPOXY OR CHEMICALS USED!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31qrNabBUZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whisk","source_asin":"B0716ZTLBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0716ZTLBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0716ZTLBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648837,"name":"Luxton Home Digital Hot Air Fryer Cooker – Family Size XL 5.8 Qt Electric Fryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e9zkgDITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxton Home Oven Air Fryer - 5.5 Liter Family Size Electric Fryer Without Oil Who doesn’t love deep-fried foods such as burgers, fries and tasty fried chicken? But when cooked with oil the conventional way these foods we love are often unhealthy. The Luxton Home all-in-one freidora de aire offers a healthy alternative to deep frying and cooking with oil, allowing you to grill, roast, bake and fry in minutes. Easy to use and time saving with it’s powerful air flow technology, the air convection fryer cooks food quickly and evenly to create meals that are much healthier and just as tasty! This state-of-the-art air cooker fries food with little or no oil. Using hot air combined with high-speed rapid air circulation and top grill to prepare a variety of perfectly cooked dishes. Quickly shake and flip food in the middle of your cooking program with the air fryer’s detachable basket! And our digital air fryers won’t create smoke, smell or heat up your kitchen. Up to 70% Less Calories. No oil means less calories and healthier meals for all the family. Faster Cooking Times. Automatic cooking made easy that frees up your time in the kitchen. Hassle-free Cleanup. Dishwasher-safe tray and basket for quick and easy cleaning. Certified Easy Load Basket and Detachable Pan- 60 Minute Digital Timer and 7 Preset Cooking Programs- Dual Convection Fans and Automatic Safety Shut Off- Cool Touch Handle with Anti-Detachment Button Guard- 180F to 400F Variable Temperature Range- Easy One-Touch LED Digital Controls- 1800 Watts of Turbo-Cyclonic Power- ETL Approved for Safety Length: 13 inchesDepth: 14 inchesHeight: 15 inches Now you can have quality, consistent and amazing tasting food at the push of a button while satisfying your deep-fried cravings. With the Luxton Home AirFryers you'll never have to compromise great-tasting food for the healthy option ever again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81e9zkgDITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxton Home","source_asin":"B07GT9PM23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GT9PM23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GT9PM23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
