window.products.push({"id":648927,"name":"AMADA HOMEFURNISHING Floating Shelves Black, Wall Shelves with Invisible Brackets for Bedroom, Bathroom, Living Room, Kitchen, Set of 3 - AMFS07","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y2bqIDrGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Engineered Wood MODERN FLOATING SHELF: Our shelf is made of MDF with a smooth matte black finish for a modern feel. Organize your room with Amada shelves for a neat and tidy look. Display your favorite art and decorate your home without adding more furniture. WIDE SHELF BOARDS: Each board measures 14.96” L x 6.69” W x 1.38” H to provide plenty of capacity for storage. Organize small items near your desktop or counter with a wider design that is suitable for books and more storage space. INVISIBLE BRACKETS: Enhanced metal brackets matched with precise screws will attach the shelves firmly to the wall. 1.4-inch thickness MDF boards can hold up to 20lbs, great for collectibles, photos, books, trophies, small plants, and more. ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES: With the functional shelves, you can easily make any room feel cleaner and more organized. Perfect for the living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and more. Great gift choice for family or friends who are looking to upgrade their space. EASY TO ASSEMBLE: Installation instructions and standard mounting hardware included for easy installation. Please contact our product support team if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51y2bqIDrGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMADA HOMEFURNISHING","source_asin":"B0C74QYLCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C74QYLCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C74QYLCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":648928,"name":"Going Away Gift For Coworker,Coworker Leaving Gifts.Goodbye,Farewell,New Job Promotion,Good Luck Gift For Colleagues,Boss,Women,Men,Friends,Good Luck ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F1Fh8+Y1L._AC_.jpg","description":"SAY FAREWELL IN STYLE - Is a co-worker leaving your workplace soon? Don’t let them go without surprising them with our goodbye tumbler - a perfect going-away gift for a special colleague. CELEBRATE THE MEMORIES - Seeing a good friend depart from the workplace is never easy. With this double-wall vacuum tumbler, you can thank your colleague for the times you shared together. DOUBLE WALL VACUUM INSULATION - Made with double-wall vacuum insulation, this 20 oz flask can retain any drink’s ideal temperature for longer. Make it your go-to container for piping hot coffee, iced cold fruit teas, juice, champagne, smoothies, sodas, ice cream, energy drinks, milkshake. BPA FREE AND DURABLE - These tumblers come with BPA-free, convenient drink lid. Crafted with 18/8 food grade stainless steel these tumblers are durable, unbreakable, sweat proof, rust resistant and perfect for backyard barbecues, hanging out at the pool, or enjoying a hot day at the beach with friends. COWORKER LEAVING GIFTS, GOING AWAY GIFT FOR COWORKER - Enjoy Your Favorite Drinks No Matter Where You Are With This Stainless Steel Tumbler. Sturdy And Leak-proof, It’s Great For Both Outdoor And Indoor Use. Bring This Tumbler With You Next Time You Go To A Picnic, Hiking Adventure, Rv Tour, Beach Outing, Or Fishing Trip.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41F1Fh8+Y1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZONEGRACE","source_asin":"B09J17F581","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-648928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J17F581","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J17F581","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
